OL,3,GNEWSABoss who quit #225k role at Wales'
OL,4,Aworst performing health board drops new
OL,5,Ajob                                    
OL,7,FThe chief executive of Wales's largest 
OL,8,Fhealth board will no longer take up a  
OL,9,Fnew post in England, following a       
OL,10,Fdamning review of her current          
OL,11,Forganisation's leadership.             
OL,13,FCarol Shillabeer, who has been Betsi   
OL,14,FCadwaladr University Health Board's    
OL,15,Fchief executive since May 2023, had    
OL,16,Fbeen due to lead the Lancashire and    
OL,17,FSouth Cumbria NHS Trust in England in  
OL,18,Fthe new year.                          
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,435,430,260,140,0,100
