OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.,%%**,$-,(,% ,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSABoss who quit #225k role at Wales'
OL,4,Aworst performing health board drops new
OL,5,Ajob                                    
OL,7,FBut a review into the Welsh health     
OL,8,Fboard found that, in some parts,       
OL,9,Ftargets and money had a "greater       
OL,10,Fpriority for senior management than the
OL,11,Fquality and safety of care".           
OL,13,FThe Lancashire and South Cumbria Trust 
OL,14,Fsaid the "seriousness of the findings" 
OL,15,Fcould not be ignored and Shillabeer    
OL,16,Fmade the "personal decision" to        
OL,17,Fwithdraw from the role.                
